# Project governance

- The coach workbook is the business source of truth. Do not invent sessions, exercises, loads, sets, reps, phases, Coach Tips, or strength tests.
- Keep workbook anomalies. Document them. Do not silently "fix" imported data.
- No secrets in git, chat, or client bundles. Never commit `.env.local`.
- Do not use `any` to hide a TypeScript error.
- No destructive git, remote database resets, or production deploys unless the user explicitly asks.
- Mobile-first. iPhone 14 Pro Max (430×932) is the primary viewport.
- Before finishing app changes, run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test`.
